Home Menu
- D — Add Deposit: Enter a description, vendor, and amount for money received.
- P — Make Payment: Record money spent.
- L — Ledger: View and filter saved transactions.
- X — Exit: Close the application.
Ledger Menu
- A — All Transactions: Show all entries, newest first.
- D — Deposits: Show positive transactions.
- P — Payments: Show negative transactions.
- R — Reports: Open the reports menu.
- H — Home: Return to the main menu.
Reports Menu
- 1 — Month To Date
- 2 — Previous Month
- 3 — Year To Date
- 4 — Previous Year
- 5 — Search By Vendor
- X — Back to Ledger (as currently implemented)

How to Run the Project
1. Make sure src/main/resources/transactions.csv exists. Run the application from the project root folder so the relative file paths work.
2. Open src/main/java/org/example/Main.java.
3. Run the main() method in the Main class.
4. Type one of the menu letters or numbers and press Enter. Follow the prompts to record or view transactions.